[ve:0.3.1]
[00:00.00]Ha— ha— ha—
[00:00.53]Shh…
[00:01.46]Ha— ha— ha—
[00:03.08]Ha— ha— ha—
[00:04.47]Shh…
[00:05.75]Don’t look inside
[00:06.76]You don’t know how to play
[00:11.93]They told me sit still
[00:12.72]They told me don’t ask why
[00:14.49]They tied me with ribbons
[00:15.52]So I can’t run or try
[00:16.80]I’ve got pieces that aren’t mine
[00:19.28]But they fit if I stay calm
[00:21.76]If I break, they fix me up
[00:24.19]If I think, they shut me down
[00:29.02]One, two,
[00:29.81]hold your breath
[00:30.37]Three, four,
[00:31.03]don’t look at yourself
[00:33.55]Welcome to the doll’s vault
[00:35.05]Smile or you’ll be replaced
[00:36.78]If you scream too loud
[00:38.14]They stitch your mouth
[00:39.40]This is not a game
[00:43.37]But you play it anyway
[00:44.49]Welcome to the doll’s vault
[00:45.67]Don’t ask what’s behind
[00:47.39]If you move too much
[00:48.66]You break everything
[00:50.06]And they
[00:56.25]Don’t 
[00:56.90]like 
[00:57.56]that 
[00:58.30]kind
[00:58.98](Hey!)
[00:59.30]♫
[01:09.80]I’ve got wires instead of stories
[01:12.12]I keep fear on airplane mode
[01:14.57]They said you’re special
[01:17.06]Like that’s a diagnosis code
[01:20.74]I don’t know when to stop
[01:23.03]I don’t know when to run
[01:25.56]If you stare at me too long
[01:27.99]I forget which side I’m on
[01:31.04]Don’t touch me
[01:32.09]Don’t command
[01:33.35]Don’t try to calibrate my hands
[01:42.52]Welcome to the doll’s vault
[01:44.06]Dance fast or you’ll be erased
[01:45.61]If you fall down
[01:46.46]Laugh real loud
[01:47.59]Pretend it
[01:48.48]Doesn’t hurt your face
[01:53.58]Welcome to the doll’s vault
[01:54.56]Everything shines, everything’s wrong
[01:56.99]If you don’t fit
[01:58.44]You’re just noise
[02:00.14]And noise
[02:03.04]Doesn’t sing for long
[02:07.14]Broken cup
[02:08.48]Broken head
[02:09.74]Who decided
[02:10.81]What’s “normal” said?
[02:12.37]If I’m crazy
[02:13.73]Let me be
[02:15.09]Pretty dolls
[02:16.02]Still bite, you see
[02:18.31]Ha-ha-ha
[02:19.97]Does it scare you?
[02:21.96]Yeah… me too
[02:23.29]If this is order
[02:24.75]I’m the mess
[02:28.44]If this is home
[02:29.88]I want it burned to ash
[02:37.83]I don’t want the doll’s vault
[02:40.74]I don’t wanna fit their frame
[02:43.50]I’d rather shatter into pieces
[02:46.21]Than live without asking names
[02:50.28]I don’t want the doll’s vault
[02:51.33]Don’t wind me up, don’t shut me down
[02:53.16]If I’m a glitch
[02:53.77]Let me jump
[02:54.43]But look at me
[02:55.19]When I come crashing out
[03:02.00]Don’t close the vault…
[03:07.50]I’m still awake.
[03:08.21]♫
